[size=5][b]◈ NEON FITTING ROOM // PHOTO MODE WARDROBE PREVIEW ◈[/b][/size]

[b]What does Neon Fitting Room do?[/b]

Photo Mode gives you plenty of outfits, poses, and expressions to work with. Neon Fitting Room makes them easier to find.

It turns the character controls into searchable card browsers, brings your [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/cyberpunk2077/mods/6945]Equipment-EX[/url] outfits and clothing into Photo Mode, and lets you build temporary looks without changing V's real equipment or saved outfits.

[b]Why use it?[/b]

Once you have dozens of outfits, hundreds of clothing items, and several pose packs installed, cycling through one option at a time stops being useful. Neon Fitting Room puts those choices in front of you, keeps related controls together, and lets you search by name.

[size=4][b]◈ QUICK READ // FEATURES ◈[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]Outfit cards[/b] — Browse No Outfit, Current Equipped Outfit, and your saved [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/cyberpunk2077/mods/6945]Equipment-EX[/url] outfits in alphabetical order.
[*][b]Clothing browser[/b] — Search your Wardrobe by item name and preview pieces from any [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/cyberpunk2077/mods/6945]Equipment-EX[/url] slot.
[*][b]Pose and expression cards[/b] — Expand Category, Pose, and Facial Expression into searchable grids for V or the active Photo Mode NPC.
[*][b]Outfit previews[/b] — Optional icon collages show the outfit's most important clothing slots, while tooltips list its contents.
[*][b]Clear and Reset[/b] — Remove V's temporary clothing choices or restore the currently selected outfit.
[*][b]Responsive layout[/b] — Choose between six and ten cards per row; the default is eight.
[*][b]Mouse-friendly controls[/b] — Scroll anywhere over the control area, including the gaps between controls and cards, without zooming the camera by accident.
[*][b]Temporary by design[/b] — Neon Fitting Room does not change inventory, equipped gear, active [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/cyberpunk2077/mods/6945]Equipment-EX[/url] outfits, or saved outfits.
[/list]

[size=4][b]◈ PRODUCT BRIEF // FITTING ROOM SYSTEM ◈[/b][/size]

[color=#58A6FF][b]PHOTO MODE WARDROBE INTERFACE — ACTIVE[/b][/color]

A good shot often starts with a simple question: which outfit, pose, or expression actually fits the scene?

Neon Fitting Room replaces repeated arrow-clicking with a visual workspace. Open a control, scan the available cards, narrow them down with search, and make a choice without leaving Photo Mode.

No inventory edits. No saved-outfit rewrites. No state carried into the next session. Just a faster way to dress the scene in front of you.

[size=4][b]◈ SUPPORTED VIEWS ◈[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]V's Photo Mode character controls
[*]Active NPC Photo Mode character controls
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/cyberpunk2077/mods/6945]Equipment-EX[/url] outfit and clothing previews
[*]Native and mod-added categories, poses, and facial expressions
[*]Optional experimental NPC Clothing for compatible characters
[/list]

